@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Criar pedido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "João Silva",
  "customerPhone": "19999999999",
  "deliveryAddress": "Rua das Pizzas, 123",
  "notes": "Sem cebola",
  "items": [
    { "pizzaName": "Calabresa", "size": "GRANDE", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 49.90 },
    { "pizzaName": "Portuguesa", "size": "MEDIA", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 39.90 }
  ]
}

### Listar pedidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders

### Filtrar por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?status=RECEIVED

### Alterar status (substitua pelo UUID retornado ao criar)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PREPARING" }
